Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:28.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.50,0:01:09.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《金边夹鼻眼镜》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.14,0:01:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是可追溯至15世纪初期的修道院帐目\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the monastery's account dating to the early 15th Century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 跟我想的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, precisely what I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但无疑这有着巨大的政治意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}But surely this has great political significance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以格外的棘手\N{\fnArial\fs30}A matter of particular delicacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.69,0:01:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉打扰你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to disturb you, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但霍普金斯警督想见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but inspector Hopkins would like to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:01:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前途无量的霍普金斯警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}The promising Inspector Hopkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.65,0:02:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}靠近火炉 暖和一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Draw up to the fire and warm your toes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.81,0:02:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望你不会在这样一个夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you have no designs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.59,0:02:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我们找事做 警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon us on such a night as this, inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.82,0:02:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的哥哥 迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my brother, Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.59,0:02:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许你们之前没见过？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you have not met before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 不然我会有印象的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure, I would have remembered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.91,0:02:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能跟你握个手吗 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I shake your hand, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以 如果你坚持的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, if you must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈德森夫人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Mrs. Hudson knows a prescription{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.78,0:02:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个柠檬茶的配方\N{\fnArial\fs30}containing hot water and a lemon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.02,0:02:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会给你弄些的 警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bring some up for you, inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.28,0:02:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那对御寒很有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll help keep out the chill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.06,0:02:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 哈德森夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.35,0:02:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Dr. Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.41,0:02:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 在他的诊所里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, in his surgery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说 这糟糕的天气\N{\fnArial\fs30}This dreadful weather{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.52,0:02:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他的诊所外排起了长队\N{\fnArial\fs30}has produced a queue into the street I'm told.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.09,0:02:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well they're wasting their time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生用来治疗所有小病的就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson's only cure for any ailment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.48,0:02:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}维他命冲剂和苹果泥\N{\fnArial\fs30}is linus powder and a grated apple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 你知道你那样说只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes, you know you only say that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.59,0:02:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为你想念医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you miss the doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.87,0:02:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雪茄？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cigar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.30,0:02:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.49,0:02:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定是什么重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be something important{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才让你在这暴风天气中出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring you out in such a gale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.95,0:02:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看过有关约克斯雷案件的最新报道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see anything of the Yoxley case in the latest editions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.72,0:03:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天我还没看过晚于15世纪的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see nothing later then the 15th Century today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在研究一本500年前的手稿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been studying a 500-year-old palimpsest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.48,0:03:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}手稿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Palimpsest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.66,0:03:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别管什么15世纪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough of the 15th Century, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你给我们带来了20世纪的新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}you bring us news in the 20th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.27,0:03:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是一个短篇报道 但内容齐全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well it's only a paragraph, and all wrong at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.94,0:03:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该不会错过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've not missed anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听到这个我就放心了 警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm relieved to hear it, inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.68,0:03:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情发生在肯特郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's down in Kent, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}距查塔姆有7英里远\N{\fnArial\fs30}seven miles from Chatham{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.31,0:03:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离铁路有3英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and three from the railway line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.12,0:03:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在3：15接到报案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wired for at 3:15, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在5：00到达查塔姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}got to Chatham at 5:00, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.92,0:03:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并展开调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}conducted my investigation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乘最后一列火车回到查理十字街\N{\fnArial\fs30}was back at Charing Cross by the last train{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后乘出租马车直接来到你这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and straight to you by cab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.16,0:03:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那意味着你对你的案子没把握\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means you're not quite certain of your case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.64,0:03:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那意味着我理不出一点头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means I can make neither head nor tale of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.52,0:03:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有作案动机 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no motive, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.35,0:03:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作案动机 警督 什么作案动机？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motive, Inspector, what motive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.34,0:03:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man is dead, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是毫无疑问的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no denying that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我看不出到底为什么 会有人希望他受到伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can see no reason between heaven and earth why anyone should wish him harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.71,0:04:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我们讲讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.47,0:04:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few years ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.77,0:04:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约克斯雷旧居被一个老人买了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yoxley Old Place was taken by an elderly man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他叫科拉姆教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the name of Professor Coram.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.87,0:04:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个残疾人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an invalid, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.16,0:04:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一半的时间待在床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}keeping his bed half the time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.79,0:04:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而剩下的另一半时间 要么是在房子里拄着拐杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the other half-hobbling about the house on a stick{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.51,0:04:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要么就坐在轮椅上\N{\fnArial\fs30}or being pushed about the grounds by the gardener{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被园丁推着\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a bath chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们到了 - 你挺笨的 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here we are. - Quite stupid, aren't you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.26,0:04:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别着急 小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now just take it easy, be very careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.82,0:04:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.41,0:04:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的秘书在哪里 马克夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now where's my secretary, Mrs. Marker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.63,0:04:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教授正在写一本学术著作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The professor is writing a learned book{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.51,0:04:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在一年前他发现有必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}and found it necessary about a year ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.51,0:04:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请一个秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take on a secretary, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.09,0:04:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威洛比 史密斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Willoughby Smith, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:04:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个刚从大学毕业的年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}a young man straight from the university.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.84,0:05:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果一个人能接受基督一性论的学说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if one can accept the doctrines of Monophysitism{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么他必然也会重新评价\N{\fnArial\fs30}then perforce one must also re-evaluate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.95,0:05:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}基督教的宗教体系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christian theology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}建议…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To suggest…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.86,0:05:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}建议…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To suggest…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.05,0:05:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者争论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or to argue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.76,0:05:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们当中谁在写这本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of us is writing this book, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还是我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you, or me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然是您\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.95,0:05:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}建议…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To suggest…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.41,0:05:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚开始 史密斯看起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the first it appears that Smith{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.05,0:05:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是一个安静的受过良好教育的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}was a quiet, well-educated fellow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.62,0:05:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且几乎没有任何缺点\N{\fnArial\fs30}with hardly any weak spot in him at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但就是这个年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet this is the lad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.65,0:05:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天早晨死在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}who met his death this morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.12,0:05:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教授的书房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the professor's study{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就目前情况看来只能是谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}under circumstances that can point only to murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.66,0:05:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谋杀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是不是说威洛比 史密斯被谋杀了 警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willoughby Smith was murdered you say, Inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.44,0:05:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.14,0:05:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的热柠檬茶 警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hot lemon drink, inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.13,0:05:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 哈德森夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you Mrs. Hudson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.97,0:05:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个在世上没有任何敌人的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}a man without a single enemy in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈德森夫人 你又在妨碍我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Hudson, you're under foot again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说几乎没有任何缺点\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you say hardly any weak spots, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.04,0:06:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那究竟是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}what exactly do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.54,0:06:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们总会有这样那样的陋习\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have vices of some kind or another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.30,0:06:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威洛比 史密斯没有前科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willoughby Smith has nothing against him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.21,0:06:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当他在阿宾汉姆上高中\N{\fnArial\fs30}either as a boy at Uppingham{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是之后在剑桥上大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}or later as a young man at Cambridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.26,0:06:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我了解到他喜欢喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although I gathered that he was fond of a drink or two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那并不是件坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well nothing wrong with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.05,0:06:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他也有点好色\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also had a bit of an eye for the ladies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.07,0:06:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萝卜青菜各有所爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each to his own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.46,0:06:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许他隐瞒了一个可怕的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps he was hiding a terrible secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.79,0:06:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}史密斯不认识邻里的任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smith knew no one in the neighborhood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.50,0:06:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟他的雇主过着一样的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lived very much as his employer did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.87,0:06:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教授埋首于他的创作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The professor was buried in his work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.47,0:06:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也没有别的事可做\N{\fnArial\fs30}and existed for nothing else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.79,0:06:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟你志趣相投啊 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man after your own heart, Sherlock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了你提过的那三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apart from the three people you have mentioned, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}房子里还有别的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}who else can be found in the house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个上了年纪的女管家 马克夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}An elderly housekeeper, Mrs. Marker, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.50,0:06:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和一个年轻的女仆 苏珊 塔尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a young maid, Susan Tarlton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那谁发现了尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who found the body?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女仆 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The maid, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.74,0:06:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说当她听见惨叫时\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said she was working in an upstairs room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.74,0:06:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她正在楼上的房间里工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she heard a cry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说当她到达书房时\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said by the time she got to the study{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.66,0:06:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}史密斯躺在了地上 受了致命伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smith was lying on the floor fatally wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:06:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.31,0:07:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.01,0:07:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教授… 教授…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.40,0:07:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was she.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:07:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女仆发誓说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The maid is prepared to swear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是他的原话\N{\fnArial\fs30}that those were his exact words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.11,0:08:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教授 是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The professor, it was she.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.13,0:08:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我画了一张草图\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've drawn up a rough plan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.32,0:08:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该会让你对教授书房的位置 有个大体的了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}that should give you a general idea of the position of the professor's study{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.46,0:08:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还包括在我看来 这个案件里各种重要的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and also the various points of the case which seem to me to be essential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如你所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.87,0:08:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从书房出来有两个走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are two corridors which lead from the study.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.51,0:08:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个直接通向房子的后门\N{\fnArial\fs30}One goes directly to a door at the back of the house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.54,0:08:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而另一个通向教授的卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the other straight to the professor's ground floor bedroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两个成90度的走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two corridors with a 90-degree angle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.61,0:08:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在书房外会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}joined at one end outside the study.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.09,0:08:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在假设凶手进了房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now assuming the assassin entered the house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.01,0:08:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他怎么进来的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}how did he get in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问从花园的小径和后门走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undoubtedly by the garden path and the back door, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那将直接\N{\fnArial\fs30}which gives direct access{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.90,0:08:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经过走廊到达书房\N{\fnArial\fs30}via the corridor to the study.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且他必须从同一条路逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he must have made his escape along the same line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为书房的其他两个出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}For of the two other exits from the study, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.67,0:08:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个被女仆堵住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}one was blocked by the maid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.99,0:08:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那时她正从楼上下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}as she ran downstairs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.38,0:09:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而另一条直接通向教授的卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the other goes straight to the professor's bedroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.89,0:09:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那凶手不能从书房的窗户逃走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could not the assassin have made his escape from the study window?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.07,0:09:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 被锁上了 先生 从里面 - 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Locked sir, from within. - I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这对于把你的理论付诸实践\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an excellent opportunity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个绝佳的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}to put your theories into practice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.19,0:09:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我注意了一下那条\N{\fnArial\fs30}I directed my attention at once to the garden path, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.81,0:09:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被最近雨水浸洗过的花园小道\N{\fnArial\fs30}which was saturated with recent rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小道上没有发现脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}No footmarks were to be found on the path{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there could be no question{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人沿着草地穿过那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}that someone had passed along the grass border, which lines it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.06,0:09:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that he'd done so{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是为了避免留下足迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}in order to avoid leaving a track.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在那里发现了脚印？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found footmarks there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.39,0:09:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 但那些草被人踩过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly, but the grass was trodden down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.59,0:09:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那只会是凶手干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it could only have been the murderer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为那天早晨包括园丁在内\N{\fnArial\fs30}since neither the gardener nor anyone else{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.00,0:09:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有人会出现在那个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}had been in the area that morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.92,0:09:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而雨是从夜里才开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the rain had only begun during the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.19,0:09:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好极了 警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo, inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.14,0:09:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你会赞赏我的分析的 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd appreciate my reasoning, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.31,0:09:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些草上的足迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}These tracks in the grass, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是来的时候留下的 还是走的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}were they coming or going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.42,0:09:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无法判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was impossible to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根本没有任何轮廓\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was never any outline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.49,0:10:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到现在居然还在刮风下雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pouring rain and blowing a hurricane ever since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.91,0:10:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在那些足迹将会比手稿更难认了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be harder to read now than the palimpsest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么警督 在你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}So inspector, what did you do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.07,0:10:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没有确定任何事情之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}after you made certain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.77,0:10:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做了什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you've made certain of nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.67,0:10:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说真的 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well really, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.03,0:10:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为我做得够好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I made certain of a good deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人小心地从屋外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody had entered the house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进了房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}cautiously from without.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.23,0:10:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后还有那个男的临死前说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there were the dying man's own words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And finally, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.79,0:10:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他紧握的右手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was a very important piece of evidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.67,0:10:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发现了一个非常重要的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}found clasped in his right hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.18,0:10:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威洛比 史密斯视力很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willoughby Smith had excellent sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}There can be no question{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.86,0:10:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个是从凶手的脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}that these were snatched from the face{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夺下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the person of the assassin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要找的是个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The person you seek is a woman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.03,0:11:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.53,0:11:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那可以从眼镜的精致推断出\N{\fnArial\fs30}That can be inferred from their delicacy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.77,0:11:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}and also, of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.30,0:11:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也可以从那男人的临终话语推断出\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the last words of the dying man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}镜框用黄金裱得非常漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're handsomely mounted in solid gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.84,0:11:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}镜片的度数很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are of unusual strength, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.14,0:11:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她肯定非常近视\N{\fnArial\fs30}she must have appalling eyesight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个因长期用眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}a lady whose vision{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.07,0:11:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而视力极度下降的 女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been so extremely contracted for any great length of time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.80,0:11:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该会有以下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}would surely carry physical characteristics{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.59,0:12:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相貌特征\N{\fnArial\fs30}of such vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.82,0:12:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有皱纹的前额\N{\fnArial\fs30}Puckered forehead, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.39,0:12:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}眼神木纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}peering expression, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}削肩\N{\fnArial\fs30}rounded shoulders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.97,0:12:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这副眼镜最近还被修过\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've also recently been repaired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.33,0:12:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 我会计划去伦敦的眼镜商那里转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I'd intended to go the round of the London opticians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.87,0:12:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上6点有列从查理十字街\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a train from Charing Cross to Chatham{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.48,0:12:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开往查特汉姆的火车 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}at 6:00 in the morning, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.15,0:12:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我得搭那列车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I shall take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.69,0:12:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有更多有关这个案件的情况 要告诉我们吗 警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you anything more to tell us about the case inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.90,0:12:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为你现在了解的跟我一样多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you know as much as I do now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.82,0:12:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.68,0:12:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我感到困惑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What puzzles me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是这个案件里完全没有动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the utter want of all object in the crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个男的被残忍地谋杀了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man has been cruelly murdered, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但没有人能讲出其中的动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not a ghost of a motive can anyone suggest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是谁向当地警察报的警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who alerted their local police?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.22,0:13:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫蒂默 那个园丁 他是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mortimer, the gardener, an innocent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.97,0:13:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当了解到这个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as it became clear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.50,0:13:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}属于苏格兰场管辖\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it was a matter for Scotland Yard, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上面便派我去做调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}the chief constable sent for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.47,0:13:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 先生 那里不能进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sir, can't go in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.08,0:13:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just walk this way please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.33,0:13:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没关系 警官 这些人是我带来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right constable, these gentlemen are with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.58,0:14:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了这个致命的裁纸刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apart from this lethal paper knife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.85,0:14:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和夹鼻眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the pince-nez, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.92,0:14:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从昨天早上开始 这个房间里的其他东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}has anything been rearranged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.25,0:14:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有被重新整理过或是被挪动过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}or removed in this room since yesterday morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.01,0:14:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 福尔摩斯先生 现场和当时一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mr. Holmes. Everything is exactly as it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.57,0:14:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尸体呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the body?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.69,0:14:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尸体倒在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The body fell here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.06,0:14:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伤口在脖子的右侧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wound was in the right side of the neck, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.71,0:14:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从后面穿到前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}from behind, forwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常好 警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent inspector, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.85,0:14:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那这个办公桌？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this bureau?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.21,0:14:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教授向我保证没有丢任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The professor assures me that nothing is missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.64,0:14:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很庆幸没有发生抢劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm satisfied that no robbery has taken place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.93,0:14:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么没跟我提到这个划痕 霍普金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you not tell me about this scratch, Hopkins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.72,0:14:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然我注意到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I noticed it of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.28,0:14:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你总能在锁孔周围找到划痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you'll always find scratches around a keyhole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来很新\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks recent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.79,0:14:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常新\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very recent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}油漆也被划掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the varnish, too, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.31,0:14:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像是犁沟两边的泥土\N{\fnArial\fs30}like earth on either side of a furrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.43,0:15:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那很重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it significant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.07,0:15:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是父亲的放大镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's father's magnifying glass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.65,0:15:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.43,0:15:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave it to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真够讽刺的 请让一让\N{\fnArial\fs30}How ironic, excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.21,0:15:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在威洛比 史密斯和凶手之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was the last person to enter this room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.92,0:15:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁是最后进这个房间的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}before Willoughby Smith and his murderer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.52,0:15:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马克夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Marker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个女管家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The housekeeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.39,0:15:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, please sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 我宁愿站着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, I prefer to stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也许听说过夏洛克 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've probably heard of Mr. Sherlock Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.07,0:15:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.61,0:15:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那并不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really not important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在威洛比 史密斯被谋杀前 你在这个房间待过？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in this room before Willoughby Smith was murdered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.16,0:15:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概一刻钟前\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a quarter of an hour before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.65,0:15:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.39,0:15:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是女管家 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the housekeeper, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得保持书房尽可能的干净整洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I try to keep the study as clean and as tidy as possible, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.41,0:15:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不是你所注意到的那些不同之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}not that you'd notice the difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.84,0:15:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是一个人在这里的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you alone in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.37,0:15:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.77,0:15:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从不在教授工作的时候到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never come in here when the professor's at work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.93,0:16:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.91,0:16:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}史密斯先生当时正在楼上的房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Smith was upstairs in his room at the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.48,0:16:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你根本就没见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you didn't see him at all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until after he…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.27,0:16:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被…\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.10,0:16:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被…\N{\fnArial\fs30}been…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.23,0:16:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时我已经把这里打扫完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd finished my housework in here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.34,0:16:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正在准备教授的午餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I was preparing the professor's lunch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.47,0:16:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这时我听见…\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I heard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.63,0:16:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我到达书房时\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time I reached the study, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.39,0:16:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}史密斯先生死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Smith was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那很明显你错过了他临死前所说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you were obviously too late to hear his last words?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.78,0:16:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了那声惨叫我没听见别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard nothing except that dreadful cry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}醒醒 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, constable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那之后你干什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.55,0:16:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我直接去了教授的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went straight to the professor's room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.57,0:16:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was horribly agitated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.62,0:16:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那声惨叫让他知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd heard enough to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.19,0:16:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有可怕的事情发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that something terrible had happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.23,0:16:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你今天早晨给这张办公桌掸灰了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you dust this bureau this morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.71,0:16:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.79,0:16:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你注意到锁旁边的擦痕了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you observe the scratch by the lock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.44,0:16:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当然没有了 马克夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you didn't, Mrs. Marker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.78,0:17:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的掸子已经把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your duster would have swept away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.49,0:17:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些油漆碎片掸掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}those scraps of varnish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.23,0:17:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钥匙在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where's the key?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.21,0:17:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教授把它挂在了表链上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The professor keeps it on his watch chain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.19,0:17:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不论什么时候？- 不论什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- At all times? - At all times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 很好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, good, good, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.69,0:17:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们有进展了 - 谢谢你 马克夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- we're making progress. - Thank you Mrs. Marker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.50,0:17:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能麻烦你让女仆到书房来一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you be so good as to ask the housemaid to come along to the study?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.05,0:17:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.75,0:17:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us see, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.57,0:17:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这张桌子能告诉我们什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what this desk reveals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.13,0:17:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 迈克罗夫特 这很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Mycroft, this is interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.51,0:17:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威洛比 史密斯手写的今天的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}An entry for today in Willoughby Smith's handwriting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}修道院 7：30\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbey, 7:30, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.73,0:17:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}how curious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.91,0:17:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我能为你解释那个 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I can answer that one for you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.38,0:17:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}科拉姆教授正在写一本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Coram is writing a book{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.19,0:17:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有关早期基督异教徒的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}about early Christian heretics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.35,0:17:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且这所房子附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there are a number of Abbey ruins{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.23,0:17:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一些修道院的废墟\N{\fnArial\fs30}within reasonable traveling distance of the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.91,0:17:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}修道院 7：30 为什么是7：30\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbey, 7:30, why 7:30?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.05,0:18:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}塔尔顿小姐 请到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Tarlton, please come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.56,0:18:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生是一位伦敦来的侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes is a detective from London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能告诉他 昨天早上的所见所闻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you tell him everything you saw and heard yesterday morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.17,0:18:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时十一二点的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was between 11:00 and 12:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}科拉姆教授还躺在床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Coram was still in bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.69,0:18:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当天气不好时 他很少在正午前起床\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the weather is poor he seldom rises before midday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.25,0:18:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马克夫人正在厨房里忙家务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Marker was busy with some work in the kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.68,0:18:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在你可以看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you can look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.51,0:19:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那当时你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.61,0:19:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那时我正在楼上的一间卧室里挂窗帘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hanging some curtains in one of the bedrooms upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.25,0:19:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}史密斯先生在他自己的房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Smith had been in his own room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.15,0:19:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过了一会儿我听见他穿过走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}At that moment I heard him walk along the passage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下楼去了书房\N{\fnArial\fs30}and descend to the study.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.43,0:19:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么这么肯定 那就是威洛比 史密斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you be sure that is was Willoughby Smith?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.00,0:19:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他的脚步声很熟悉 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he had a familiar tread, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有听见书房的关门声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't hear the study door close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过了一两分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a minute or so later{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}便传来了一声惨叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}there came a dreadful cry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.07,0:19:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是令人毛骨悚然的尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a wild horrid scream, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.15,0:19:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么的奇怪和反常\N{\fnArial\fs30}so strange and unnatural.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.14,0:19:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无法辨别发出那声音的是男还是女\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could have come either from a man or a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.84,0:19:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跑下来 去了书房\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran down to the study.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.64,0:20:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发现威洛比躺在了地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found Willoughby lying on the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.45,0:20:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看见了血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw the blood, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.85,0:20:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't realize, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.50,0:20:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一定死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he must be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.35,0:20:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后他说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he spoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.89,0:20:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was she.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.64,0:20:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教授 是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor, it was she.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.36,0:20:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好奇怪的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curious words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.14,0:20:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道这是什么意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what they mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.99,0:20:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.60,0:20:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.74,0:20:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.34,0:20:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你听到惨叫后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could anyone have left by the rear exit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.51,0:20:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人从后门离开过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}after the time you'd heard the scream?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.24,0:20:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说在我下楼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean before I got down the stairs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.05,0:20:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我应该会在走廊看见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have seen them in the passage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.91,0:21:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且后门从没打开过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the backdoor never opened{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.41,0:21:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则我会听见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I would have heard it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.18,0:21:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 塔尔顿小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Miss Tarlton, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.54,0:21:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克罗夫特 警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft, inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.16,0:21:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许他是因为跟爱人吵架而被害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps he was the victim of a lover's quarrel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.87,0:21:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那他死得真不值\N{\fnArial\fs30}How very tiresome for the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.27,0:21:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快中午了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nearly midday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教授还待在他的卧室里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will the professor still be in his room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.51,0:21:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他从昨天早上开始还没离开过那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he hasn't left it since yesterday morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你得跟我介绍介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you must introduce me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.31,0:21:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.74,0:21:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两条走廊都是铺的椰衣垫 （椰子壳纤维编成的垫子）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both corridors are lined with coconut matting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.35,0:21:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我注意到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've noticed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.37,0:21:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这跟案子有什么关系呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.82,0:21:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那似乎对我很有启发性\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems to me to be suggestive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.78,0:21:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不见得吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.14,0:21:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.63,0:22:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关上门 霍普金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the door, Hopkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.04,0:22:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}寒冷的空气对我的支气管炎没好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cold air won't help my bronchial condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.71,0:22:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们其中一个肯定是夏洛克 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of you gentlemen must be Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.10,0:22:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的哥哥 迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my brother, Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.40,0:22:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你抽烟吗 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a smoker, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.66,0:22:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抽烟是我唯一的陋习\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have few other vices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.90,0:22:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 亚历山大烟草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Alexandrian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.07,0:22:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 请抽一支 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, Pray take a cigarette. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.73,0:22:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们是由朗内德为我特别准备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have them especially prepared by lonides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.03,0:22:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每次给我送来1000支\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sends me 1, 000 at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.91,0:22:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很苦恼不得不每隔两周\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grieve to say that I have to arrange{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.04,0:22:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安排一次新的送货\N{\fnArial\fs30}a fresh supply every fortnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.69,0:22:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你呢 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.40,0:23:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 谢了 不 我更喜欢这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you, no, I prefer this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.85,0:23:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}烟草和工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tobacco and my work, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.02,0:23:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只剩下这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's all there is left of me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.12,0:23:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}烟草和工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}tobacco and my work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.84,0:23:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 只有烟草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, only tobacco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.27,0:23:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁能预见如此可怕的灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who could have foreseen such a terrible catastrophe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.38,0:23:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向你保证 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.91,0:23:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在仅仅几个月的训练后\N{\fnArial\fs30}that after, what, just a few months, training, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.98,0:23:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就成为了一个非常好的助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was an admirable assistant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.90,0:23:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对这个案子你有什么看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think of the matter, hey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.21,0:23:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还没有理出头绪来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not yet made up my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.00,0:23:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会对你很感激的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would indeed be indebted to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.02,0:23:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你能在黑暗中\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you could throw a light{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.55,0:23:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我们带来一丝曙光\N{\fnArial\fs30}on all that is dark to us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.57,0:24:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于像我这样一个半瘫痪的可怜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}such a blow, paralyzing to a poor, old bookworm, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.27,0:24:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}病弱的老书呆子也算是一种慰藉\N{\fnArial\fs30}invalid, like myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.33,0:24:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能继续写你的著作吗 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you not continue with your work, professor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.61,0:24:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哎呀 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alas Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.90,0:24:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我似乎失去了思考的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seem to have lost the faculty of thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.82,0:24:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.61,0:24:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我最伟大的作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}My magnum opus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.57,0:24:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对在叙利亚和埃及的\N{\fnArial\fs30}my analysis of documents{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.59,0:24:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埃及土人的修道院内\N{\fnArial\fs30}found in the Coptic monasteries{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.33,0:24:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到的文件进行分析\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Syria and Egypt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.41,0:24:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望能够 在现有的宗教基础上深入研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a work that I hoped to have cut deep at the very foundations of revealed religion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.57,0:24:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这真令人叹为观止\N{\fnArial\fs30}This looks impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.57,0:24:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我的健康每况愈下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with my enfeebled health, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.14,0:24:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know that I shall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.54,0:24:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在没有助手的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever be able to complete it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.42,0:24:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还能不能把它写完\N{\fnArial\fs30}without my assistant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.36,0:24:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想用什么冗长的调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to trouble you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.76,0:24:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来打扰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a lengthy examination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.70,0:24:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}简单地说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simply, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.81,0:25:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只想问你 威洛比 史密斯的遗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}to ask you what Willoughby Smith{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.83,0:25:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}meant by his last words, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.52,0:25:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「教授 是她」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The professor, it was she?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.71,0:25:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苏珊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Susan, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.01,0:25:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个乡村姑娘 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}a country girl, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.58,0:25:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定注意到了那个阶级\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be aware of the incredible stupidity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.68,0:25:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令人难以置信的愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}of that class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.47,0:25:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}设想一下 我那可怜的助手 低声说了一些不连贯的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fancy the poor fellow murmured some incoherent words{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.47,0:25:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而她硬把它们组成毫无意义的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she twisted them into a meaningless message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.86,0:25:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于这场悲剧 你对自己的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no explanation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.74,0:25:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出现在遗言里就没有任何解释？\N{\fnArial\fs30}yourself for the tragedy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.94,0:25:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.06,0:25:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下面的话我只想在我们之间说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I breathe this only among ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.59,0:25:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.54,0:25:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.25,0:25:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}年轻人有他们所不为人知的麻烦 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young men have their hidden troubles, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.60,0:25:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许是感情破裂的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}an affair of the heart perhaps, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.07,0:26:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些是我们不可能知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which we will never know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.03,0:26:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是一种比谋杀更有可能的假设\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a more probable supposition than murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.17,0:26:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那夹鼻眼镜又作何解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of the pince-nez?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.38,0:26:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一把扇子 一只手套 一副眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fan, a glove, eye-glasses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.29,0:26:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁知道人临死前会带着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knows what article may be carried as a token{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.19,0:26:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}纪念品或是值钱的东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}or treasured when a man puts an end to his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.42,0:26:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得离开这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.04,0:26:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我说话像个小孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly I speak as a child, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.54,0:26:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但在我看来 威洛比 史密斯是自杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}seems to me Willoughby Smith met his fate by his own hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.74,0:26:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威洛比 史密斯是被谋杀的 他没有自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willoughby Smith was murdered. He did not commit suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.98,0:26:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下午好 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.34,0:26:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.90,0:26:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那教授所说的对这个案子毫无帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the professor's theory has no bearing on the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.14,0:26:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能麻烦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you be good enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.50,0:26:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}替我安排马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}to arrange carriage and escort for me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.87,0:27:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和火车的行程吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}as far as the railway station?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.95,0:27:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.28,0:27:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得回去一趟 所以我会带你一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get back to town so I'll take you there myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.69,0:27:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.10,0:27:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为你会觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you might find{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.05,0:27:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这比亚历山大烟草\N{\fnArial\fs30}this more beneficial{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.49,0:27:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}than Alexandrian tobacco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.78,0:27:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还记得在我们年轻的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember what papa used to tell us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.42,0:27:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲是怎么教导我们的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we were young?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.95,0:27:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除去不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eliminate the impossible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.80,0:27:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管剩下什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and whatever remains, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.26,0:27:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不管剩下的如何不大可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}however improbable, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.07,0:27:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那一定就是真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}must be the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.69,0:27:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我忘了他的原话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forget his exact words{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.52,0:27:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我说的基本接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}but those are near enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.88,0:27:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.92,0:27:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾奥尼迪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ionides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.55,0:27:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没注意到一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm overlooking something, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.29,0:27:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但它就在我眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's staring me in the face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.85,0:27:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.79,0:28:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坏消息 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad news I'm afraid, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.18,0:28:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到今天很晚才有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't another train for Charing Cross{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.64,0:28:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去查理十字街的火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}till late this evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.04,0:28:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该在把我拽到这里来之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should double-check the railway timetable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.88,0:28:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仔细检查火车时刻表\N{\fnArial\fs30}before dragging me to this wretched place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.18,0:28:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 先生 抱歉 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know sir and I'm sorry sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.89,0:28:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等一下 警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a minute, inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.25,0:28:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以等会儿回伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}London can wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.48,0:28:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为我们应该推迟我们行程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should postpone our trip for a little while{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.90,0:28:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去参加一个政治集会\N{\fnArial\fs30}to attend a political meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.20,0:28:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们总是听到改革改革\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hear of reform after reform.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.83,0:28:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不该支持这些女性 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't encourage these women, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.67,0:28:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她们是闹事者 比罪犯好不到哪儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're troublemakers, no better then criminals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.09,0:28:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}组织者 阿比盖尔 格罗斯比小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Organizer, Miss Abigail Grosby{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.69,0:28:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}7点半\N{\fnArial\fs30}meeting held in the church hall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.93,0:28:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在教堂集会\N{\fnArial\fs30}at half past 7:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.88,0:28:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想想吧 警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think back inspector, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.18,0:28:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威洛比 史密斯的日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willoughby Smith's diaries, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.68,0:28:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}修道院 7：30\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbey 7:30.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.77,0:28:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能小声点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.34,0:28:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢你们如此的敏锐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you gentlemen for your sensitivity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.17,0:28:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们总是听到改革改革\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hear of reform after reform{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.34,0:28:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但仍然没有采取任何措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet still nothing is done{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.42,0:29:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来提高女性的社会地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}to improve the position of women in society.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.70,0:29:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们国家的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fate of our country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.54,0:29:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仍然只是由男性来决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}is still being decided by men alone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.40,0:29:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而女性\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet women, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.72,0:29:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在法律上\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are subjected daily and equally{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.12,0:29:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}具有同等的地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the laws of the land, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.72,0:29:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却不允许投票\N{\fnArial\fs30}are not permitted to vote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.90,0:29:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那一定是阿比盖尔 格罗斯比小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must be Miss Abigail Grosby, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.25,0:29:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}formidable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.19,0:29:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女性选举权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Votes for women indeed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.94,0:29:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接下来是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever next, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.44,0:29:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}women police, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.22,0:29:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女政治家？\N{\fnArial\fs30}women politicians?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.41,0:29:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我再次警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to tell you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.15,0:29:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女权解放运动\N{\fnArial\fs30}The struggle for female enfranchisement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.58,0:29:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 至今都是以和平的方式进行 - 上帝禁止这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}- has so far beena peaceful one. - God forbid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.84,0:29:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}时机成熟了 我们必须扪心自问\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time has come and we must ask ourselves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.18,0:29:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个国家还会像这样持续多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}how much longer the state of affairs can continue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.68,0:29:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还应该忍受\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer we should allow ourselves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.10,0:29:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}二等公民的待遇多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be treated like second-class citizens?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.57,0:29:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你告诉他们吧 阿比盖尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell them Abigail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.34,0:29:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poppycock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.39,0:29:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想给你们读一封\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to read you a letter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.75,0:29:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我两天前收到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I received two days ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.03,0:29:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来自加勒特 福塞特夫人的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Mrs. Garrett Fawcett, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.98,0:30:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她敦促我们继续斗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}urging us to continue the fight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.07,0:30:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到实现目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we achieve our aims.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.50,0:30:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那应该会让你感兴趣的 警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should interest you, inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.18,0:30:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 哦 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.02,0:30:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.11,0:30:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在各个领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}On every side, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.66,0:30:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些有能力帮助的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}those in a position to help, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.45,0:30:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全都装聋作哑\N{\fnArial\fs30}are stricken by deafness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.61,0:30:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们被告知这个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're told that the country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.93,0:30:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有比女性选举权更重要的事需要担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}has more important things to worry about than votes for women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.31,0:30:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet tell me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.56,0:30:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有什么比占总人口数一半的人的权利更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}what can be more important than the rights of half of the population?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.82,0:30:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已故的的女王不也是个女人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was the late queen not also a woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.05,0:31:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经忍了这些犯罪课堂一天了 警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have had quite enough of the criminal classes for one day, inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.89,0:31:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你给我约的那辆马车在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's that carriage you promised me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.88,0:31:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真的一无所知 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know nothing about nothing, sir, honest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.15,0:31:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你干吗哭呢 塔尔顿小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why are you crying Miss Tarlton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.39,0:31:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我不想惹上麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause I don't want to be in no trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.77,0:31:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则我会丢了工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll lose my situation if I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.55,0:31:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我再问你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll ask you one more time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.12,0:31:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威洛比 史密斯是不是认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}was Willoughby Smith acquainted with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.24,0:31:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个叫阿比盖尔 格罗斯比的女教师\N{\fnArial\fs30}the schoolteacher Miss Abigail Grosby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.92,0:31:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.42,0:31:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道的 塔尔顿小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know Miss Tarlton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.61,0:31:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}撒谎是没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's useless to lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.64,0:31:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他是认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.22,0:31:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们互相认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knew each other all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.97,0:31:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们是情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had a blazing row.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.68,0:31:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾比 请你听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abby, will you listen to me please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.11,0:31:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day before yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.18,0:32:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你正在为这些选举权 浪费你的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting your time on these suffrages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.09,0:32:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道你看不出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.64,0:32:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 威洛比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Willoughby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.57,0:32:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的支持真是一如既往的势不可挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your support is overwhelming as ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.08,0:32:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说他爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he loved me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.39,0:32:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照顾我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.66,0:32:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我相信了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I believed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.13,0:32:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 别碰我 - 艾比 艾比 艾比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't you touch me. - Abby, Abby, Abby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.94,0:32:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 别碰我 - 好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't touch me. - All right, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.05,0:32:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是想让你理智一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to make you see reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.02,0:32:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你整天和这些几乎不认识的人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're spending your time with these people you barely know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.26,0:32:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该跟我一起生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you should be building a life with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.13,0:32:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your hands off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.66,0:32:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝都知道她们中有一半 是最最低劣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows half of them are the lowest of the low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.33,0:32:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不该跟这些人混在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are not the sort of people that you should be mixing with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.46,0:32:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.30,0:32:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I choose to do with it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.70,0:32:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要跟什么人一起做都是我的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}and who I choose to do it with is my business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.67,0:32:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人能阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one is going to stand in my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.40,0:32:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I make myself clear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.15,0:32:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果那是你所想要的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's what you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.58,0:32:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很确切地知道我想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know exactly what I want{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.35,0:32:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但此时此刻并不包括你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and at the moment it doesn't include you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.52,0:33:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是女权解放运动让你这么想的 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what emancipation does for a woman, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.76,0:33:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你喝酒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been drinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.22,0:33:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉过你喝酒后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've told you not to come near me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.65,0:33:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别靠近我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you've been drinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.85,0:33:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它让你拒绝了我的求婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes you turn down a good offer of marriage, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.35,0:33:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一次可以真正快乐的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}a chance to be really happy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.94,0:33:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却成为了一个不幸的 好卖弄学问的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of a miserable blue stocking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.56,0:33:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你最好离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd better leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.99,0:33:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.86,0:33:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为你会觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you might find this more beneficial{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.11,0:33:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这比亚历山大烟草更管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}than Alexandrian tobacco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.57,0:35:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的视力良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing wrong with her sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.26,0:35:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿比盖尔 格罗斯比小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Abigail Grosby, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.81,0:35:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克罗斯比小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Crosby, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.21,0:35:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夏洛克 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.62,0:35:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警督无疑已经向你解释了目前的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}The inspector has no doubt explained state of things to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.25,0:35:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你应该知道你的不利处境\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you know the seriousness of your position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.43,0:35:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有什么要为自己辩护的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have anything to say in your defense?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.51,0:35:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有那个我被指控的 莫须有的罪名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only that I am innocent of the crime of which I am accused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.73,0:35:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你知道他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you did know the deceased?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.85,0:35:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也算是犯罪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that also a crime?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.30,0:35:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们曾是很亲密的朋友 直到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were close friends until…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.46,0:35:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.61,0:35:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在他心目中的位置 比他在我心目中的位置要重要的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant more to him than he did to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.85,0:35:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在意识到了这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realize that now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.35,0:35:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但无论如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for all the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.33,0:36:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都不希望他受到伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not have wished him any harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.77,0:36:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警督告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The inspector informed me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.22,0:36:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你跟威洛比 史密斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you had a violent quarrel with Willoughby Smith{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.84,0:36:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他死的前一天吵得很凶\N{\fnArial\fs30}the day before he died?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.81,0:36:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}双方的谈吐都很粗鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were harsh words spoken on both sides, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.11,0:36:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但有很好的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}but with good reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.05,0:36:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你或许知道我是个 女性选举权运动的积极份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably know that I'm an active member of the women's suffrage movement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.81,0:36:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威洛比认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willoughby believed, selfishly I think, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.67,0:36:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在拿自己未来的生活和自由冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my future way of life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.19,0:36:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我认为那是他自私的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my liberty were at great risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.77,0:36:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我再次向他保证 我们在这里的运动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I reassured him that our campaign here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.12,0:36:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是尽可能地以和平的方式进行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}was as peaceful as may be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.55,0:36:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想为了改变法律 而违反它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no wish to break the law in order to change it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.53,0:36:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非…\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.58,0:36:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于你在书房的办公桌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regarding, your bureau in the study, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.96,0:36:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里面有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}does it contain anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.84,0:36:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是别人想偷的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}which someone might wish to steal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.11,0:36:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我所知没有值钱的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing of value that I know of, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.44,0:36:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我妻子寄过来的家书\N{\fnArial\fs30}family papers and letters from my poor wife, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.13,0:36:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}值得我骄傲的大学毕业证书\N{\fnArial\fs30}diplomas from universities that have done me honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.94,0:37:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是钥匙 你可以自己去看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have the key, you can look for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.20,0:37:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鼻烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.66,0:37:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的午餐 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your lunch professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.10,0:37:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不饿吗 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not hungry, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.89,0:37:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些香烟可不会提高你的食欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those cigarettes don't help your appetite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.33,0:37:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无疑出于同样的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the same reason no doubt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.78,0:37:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教授也没吃多少东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the professor returns to the kitchen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.65,0:37:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而把更多的送回了厨房\N{\fnArial\fs30}more food than he eats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.45,0:38:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I to assume{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.43,0:38:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有进一步进展了是吗 警督\N{\fnArial\fs30}there have been further developments, inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.90,0:38:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是这么被告知的 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm told, professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.47,0:38:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很遗憾 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fail to see, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.42,0:38:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无法再给予你进一步的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}how I can be of any further assistance to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.20,0:38:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把我所知道的每一个环节\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forged and tested{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.84,0:38:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都串起来了 科拉姆教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}every link of my chain, Professor Coram, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.36,0:38:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且我肯定这就是真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm sure that it is sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.23,0:38:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他到底在胡说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What on earth is he talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.77,0:38:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两天前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.75,0:38:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个女人进了你的书房\N{\fnArial\fs30}a woman entered your study.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.54,0:38:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她来的目的很明确\N{\fnArial\fs30}She came with express intention{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.86,0:38:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是要拿走你办公桌里的某些文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}of taking certain papers, which were held in your bureau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.79,0:38:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她有一把自己的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had a key of her own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.04,0:39:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你自己的钥匙上并没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your own key doesn't have that slight discoloration, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.33,0:39:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刮掉油漆后所留下的小斑点\N{\fnArial\fs30}which the scratch made upon the varnish would have produced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.55,0:39:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是在诋毁你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She came, as far as my evidence can tell me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.52,0:39:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}without your knowledge, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.57,0:39:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如我的证据所显示的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}to rob you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.92,0:39:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然现在你已经追查出这位女士了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now surely having traced this lady so far, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.29,0:39:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你也能告诉我她后来怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can also say what has since become of her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.48,0:39:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会尽力那么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall endeavor to do so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.09,0:40:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首先 她被你的秘书抓住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the first place, she was seized by your secretary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.66,0:40:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她为了逃走而刺伤了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}She stabbed him in order to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.76,0:40:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是个不幸的意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an unhappy accident, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.25,0:40:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我确信那位女士并无意\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I am convinced that the lady had no intention{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.85,0:40:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想杀害他\N{\fnArial\fs30}of inflicting so grievous an injury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.26,0:40:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于被她的所为吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horrified by what she had done, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.65,0:40:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她匆忙地逃离了案发现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}she rushed wildly away from the scene of the tragedy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.80,0:40:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但不幸的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately for her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.60,0:40:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她在扭打中丢失了她的夹鼻眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}she lost her pince-nez in the scuffle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.89,0:40:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她跑过走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She ran down the corridor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.73,0:40:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本该是从来的那条路逃走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which she imagined to be that by which she had come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.52,0:40:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但两条走廊铺的都是椰衣垫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both were lined with coconut matting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.15,0:40:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当她发现自己走错了的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only when it was too late, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.20,0:40:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}did she understand that she had taken the wrong passage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.68,0:40:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为她回去的路被切断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that her retreat was cut off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.27,0:40:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was she to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.08,0:40:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不能往回走\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could not go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.55,0:40:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她也不能待在走廊里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could not remain where she was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.50,0:40:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她必须继续往前走\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.92,0:40:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}She went on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.60,0:41:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常好 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}All very fine, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.30,0:41:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是不是想说我躺在床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want me to say that I could lie in that bed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.98,0:41:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not be aware{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.38,0:41:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个陌生的女人进了我的房间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that a strange woman had entered my room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.60,0:41:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当然注意到她了 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you were aware of her professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.45,0:41:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从这些烟雾中就认出她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You recognized her through this haze of your existence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.70,0:41:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你跟她讲话了 - 你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You spoke with her. - You're mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.30,0:41:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你帮助她躲过了警察 - 你在说疯话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You helped her to elude the police. - You're talking insanely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.46,0:41:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我帮助她躲过了警察？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I helped her to elude the police?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.34,0:41:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那她现在在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well where is she now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.77,0:41:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里 她一直待的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, where she has been all along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.61,0:41:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are right, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.70,0:41:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.41,0:41:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.51,0:42:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能听见一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could hear everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.12,0:42:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你已经了解了真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know that you have learned the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.64,0:42:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说那是个意外是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you were right to say it was an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.25,0:42:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道手里拿的是裁纸刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not know it was a knife in my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.63,0:42:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时感到绝望的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}For in my despair, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.47,0:42:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会抓起任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I snatched at anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.08,0:42:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打晕他 让他放我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and struck at him to make him let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.64,0:42:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只剩下一点时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have only a little time here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.98,0:42:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会让你知道全部的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I would have, that you know the whole truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.84,0:42:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是这个男人的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I am this man's wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.51,0:42:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不是英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not an Englishman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.21,0:42:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是俄国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a Russian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.02,0:42:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么如此地渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should you cling so hard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.87,0:42:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你那令人作呕的生活 瑟吉厄斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}to that retched life of yours, Sergius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.83,0:43:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你伤害了太多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has done harm to so many{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.68,0:43:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有人从中受益\N{\fnArial\fs30}and good to none, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.42,0:43:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至你自己也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}not even yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.41,0:43:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我们在圣彼得堡结婚的时候 你50岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were 50 and I, a young girl, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.42,0:43:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我还是个年轻的姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we married in St. Petersburg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.07,0:43:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我那么地爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.07,0:43:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比那更甚\N{\fnArial\fs30}More then that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.99,0:43:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我极度崇拜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I idolized you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.77,0:43:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会为你做任何事 并且我也那样做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have done anything for you, and I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.90,0:43:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为那时你是我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because then you were everything to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.13,0:43:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们是改革家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we were reformers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.49,0:43:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虚无主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nihilists, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.59,0:43:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很快大麻烦就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and soon there came a time of great trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.97,0:44:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瑟吉厄斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.14,0:44:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瑟吉厄斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.84,0:44:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 瑟吉厄斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sergius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.85,0:44:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能再有伤亡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}no more deaths{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.04,0:44:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要再有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.56,0:44:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瑟吉厄斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.00,0:45:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瑟吉厄斯在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Sergius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.03,0:45:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忘了你的丈夫吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget your husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.61,0:45:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他背叛了我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has betrayed us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.08,0:45:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不 - 是的 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Yes, Anna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.96,0:45:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们被背叛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are betrayed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.30,0:45:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们因为你的招供全被抓了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were all arrested upon your confession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.85,0:45:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们中的一些人被判处绞刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us went to the gallows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.15,0:45:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而另外一些被流放到了西伯利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some of us to Siberia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.57,0:45:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过了20年我才被释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}After 20 years I was released.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.53,0:45:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你带着你那血腥钱来到了英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came to England with your blood money{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.47,0:46:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从此过着宁静的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lived in quiet ever since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.67,0:46:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowing well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.99,0:46:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要组织一旦找到你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}that if the brotherhood ever found out where you were{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.23,0:46:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不出一个星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a week would pass{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.69,0:46:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你将会受到公正的裁决\N{\fnArial\fs30}before justice would be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.24,0:46:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就在你手上 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in your hands, Anna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.82,0:46:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你总是对我那么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were always good to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.75,0:46:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的弟弟亚历克西斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother, Alexis, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.15,0:46:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个高尚无私的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}was noble, unselfish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.90,0:46:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他讨厌暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hated violence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.74,0:46:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还写了很多信\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wrote many letters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.41,0:46:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}试图劝阻我们不要继续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to dissuade us from such a course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.78,0:46:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些信将会证明他是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These letters would have proved his innocence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.95,0:46:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你把它们从我这里偷走藏起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you stole them from me and hid them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.16,0:46:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以亚历克西斯被流放到了西伯利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Alexis was sent to Siberia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.88,0:46:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至今还被关在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}where he is even now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.24,0:46:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的刑期一满\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as my time of imprisonment is over, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.55,0:46:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就决定取回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I determined to get the letters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.40,0:46:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些能释放我弟弟的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would procure my brother's release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.56,0:47:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道我的丈夫来到了英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that my husband had come to England{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.11,0:47:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在好几个月的调查后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and after many months of searching{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.23,0:47:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确定了你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I determined where he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.93,0:47:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以最后我决定自己取回那些信件\N{\fnArial\fs30}So at last I determined to get the letters for myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.39,0:47:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我才刚刚把它们从办公桌里拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had just removed them from the bureau{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.66,0:47:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这时那个年轻人抓住了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the young man seized me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.52,0:47:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那天早上早些时候我还遇到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}the same young man I had met earlier that morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.46,0:47:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我问他科拉姆教授住在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had asked him where Professor Coram lived{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.72,0:47:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但并不知道他就在他手下工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}not knowing that he worked for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.85,0:47:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那他也一定跟教授谈到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he must have told the professor about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.26,0:47:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教授 是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The professor, it was she.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.38,0:47:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他倒下后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he had fallen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.06,0:47:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跑了 但我走错了门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran but I went to the wrong door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.54,0:47:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来到了他的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}and found myself in his room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.86,0:47:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你 你说要把我供出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, you talked of giving me up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.40,0:47:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉过你 如果你那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I showed you that if you did so{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.99,0:48:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就毁了你的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}your life was in my hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.94,0:48:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你把我交给警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you gave me to the law{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.94,0:48:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就把你交给组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could give you to the Brotherhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.14,0:48:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那样我们的生命 就首次在婚后有了羁绊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That as our liveshad once been bound together in marriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.68,0:48:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的命运也因此 永远交织在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}So our destinies would forever be entwined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.87,0:48:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[俄语]
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.22,0:48:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.65,0:48:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也绝不会开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never began.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.43,0:48:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的饭菜被送到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had your meals sent in here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.03,0:48:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那样她就能跟你一起吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}so she could share your food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.02,0:48:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们俩达成协议 当警察离开后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was agreed that when the police left{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.07,0:48:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她就趁着夜色逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}that she should slip away into the night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.95,0:48:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并再也不相见\N{\fnArial\fs30}and never be seen again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.37,0:48:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些信可以救我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the letters that will save my brother's life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.75,0:48:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把它们送去俄国大使馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them to the Russian embassy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.69,0:49:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毒药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.99,0:49:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一封手写的信 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}A letter by hand, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.46,0:49:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 哈德森夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you Mrs. Hudson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.55,0:49:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}睡个好觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}sleep well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.21,0:50:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很明显 从眼镜的度数来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was clear to me from the strength of the spectacles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.55,0:50:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果被弄丢了 其佩带者必定跟瞎了一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the wearer must have been almost blind without them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.20,0:50:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此我作出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I therefore considered the hypothesis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.43,0:50:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她仍留在房子里的假设\N{\fnArial\fs30}that she remained within the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.60,0:50:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也许会说这很容易想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might say it was elementary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.73,0:50:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, by the way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.37,0:50:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别跟华生提起鼻烟的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't mention the snuff to Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.26,0:50:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他你故意掉下了 一些烟灰或什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him you dropped a cigarette ash or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.04,0:50:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别让我惹上麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.06,0:50:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但到底为什么 那位令人作呕的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why on earth did the retched woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.71,0:50:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不得不自杀呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}feel compelled to take her own life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.33,0:50:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她达到了她的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd achieved her purpose, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.23,0:50:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无希望并且深处绝望之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}past hope and in despair, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.42,0:50:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然还有为爱殉情\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the death of love, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.63,0:50:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, professor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.04,0:50:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}望你罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}be sure your sin will find you out.{\r}
